@startuml state_memory_automation_component
title Codex data flow: rollout + state.sqlite + memories + hooks + app-server

' High resolution output (primarily for PNG). SVG ignores DPI.
skinparam dpi 300

!pragma layout elk
!theme aws-orange
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 80

top to bottom direction

actor "User (TUI/CLI)" as User
rectangle "Automation client\n(Codex App / CI / bot)" as Automation

package "Local machine" {
  component "codex-core\n(session engine)" as Core
  component "Session state\n(in-memory history)" as Session
  component "Memory startup pipeline\n(stage1 extract + stage2 consolidate)" as MemPipe
  component "Hooks runner\n(codex-hooks)" as Hooks
  component "MCP client\n(JSON-RPC)" as McpClient
  component "App server\n(codex-app-server,\nJSON-RPC v2)" as AppServer

  database "rollout.jsonl\n(append-only event log)\n~/.codex/rollouts/..." as Rollout
  database "state.sqlite\n(projection/index + locks)\n~/.codex/state.sqlite" as StateDb
  folder "memories/\n~/.codex/memories/...\n- memory_summary.md\n- raw_memories.md\n- rollout_summaries/" as MemFS
}

cloud "LLM providers\n(OpenAI / Gemini / Grok / ...)" as Providers
rectangle "MCP servers\n(npx / local processes)" as McpServers
rectangle "Hook targets\n(entireio/cli adapter,\nscripts/webhooks)" as HookTargets

User --> Core : prompts / commands
Core --> Session : update history\n+ maintain session config

Core --> Rollout : append Turn/Item events\n(source of truth)
Core --> StateDb : upsert thread index/metadata\n+ jobs/locks\n+ stage1_outputs (memory)
StateDb ..> Rollout : backfill/reconcile\n(derive projection from rollout)

Core --> Providers : /responses\n(with memory tool instructions)
Core --> McpClient
McpClient --> McpServers : tool calls

Core --> Hooks : emit HookPayload\n(AfterAgent/AfterToolUse/AfterMcpToolCall)
Hooks --> HookTargets : exec/notify/persist

Core --> MemFS : read active memory_summary.md\n(cwd > user > global)
MemFS --> Core : MemoryLink\n(scope_kind/scope_version/\nsummary_sha256/binding_key)

Core --> MemPipe : schedule startup task (background)
MemPipe --> Rollout : scan candidate rollouts
MemPipe --> Providers : stage1 extract + stage2 consolidate
MemPipe --> StateDb : stage1 outputs + job heartbeats
MemPipe --> MemFS : write/update memory_summary.md

Automation --> AppServer : thread/* turn/* model/*
AppServer --> Core : drive turns via v2
AppServer --> Automation : notifications/events

note right of Rollout
  Rollout is the authoritative event log.
  State DB must be fully reconstructible
  from rollouts + config.
end note

note right of StateDb
  State DB is NOT authoritative.
  It speeds up listing/search, and
  coordinates background jobs (locks).
end note

@enduml
